      "category": "nature",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "The western edge of Mount Cobb channels water west via Rock Bottom Creek to Roaring Brook, a tributary of the Susquehanna River.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
